      "path": "Vargul_Collection_for_Zip/README.txt",
      "bytes": 610,
      "text": "VARGUL THE FROZEN GRAVELORD — IMAGE COLLECTION (UPDATED)\n\n01_characters_and_sprite_sheets:\n  Character reference illustrations, phase 1/phase 2 sprites and motion sheets.\n  Vargul_P1_INTRO_Ice_Throne_16frames_NEW.png is the latest revised intro:\n  he rises from an ice throne, snaps his fingers, and the throne shatters.\n\n02_effects_16frame_only:\n  Contains ONLY the three expanded 16-frame visual-effects sheets.\n  Older short-frame versions were intentionally excluded.\n\nThe original animation sheets are preserved as produced; the pictures\nshould be inspected before cropping into fixed frame rectangles.\n"
